# Normalise line endings for every checkout, on every platform.
#
# `prettier.config.js` sets `endOfLine: 'lf'`, but Git for Windows defaults to
# `core.autocrlf=true` and converts text files to CRLF on checkout. The result was that a
# Windows clone failed `npm run format:check` on every file while the committed source was
# already correctly formatted — the working tree, not the code, was wrong.
#
# With this file the index and every working tree use LF regardless of platform or
# `core.autocrlf`, so formatting checks are reproducible. Do not remove it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must stay LF to remain executable inside the container.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
